<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Masisa started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Masisa started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HSBC James Capel said Tuesday it had started coverage of Chilean wood products maker Maderas y Sinteticos SA, or Masisa, with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- The firm's analysis said in part it expected better domestic volumes this year and next in Chile and Argentina.</p>
<p>-- It expects a 93 percent increase in Masisa's operating income this year and said the acquisition of an Infodema SA unit would allow for a five percent hike in domestic prices.</p>
<p>-- Its 12-month price target on Masisa's American Depositary Receipts is $17.50.</p>
<p>-- Masisa's ADRs were unchanged at 17-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1879))</p>
